@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### Login como admin de Iron Gym (copia el accessToken de la respuesta)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@iron-gym.dev",
  "password": "IronAdmin123!"
}

### Ahora pega el token aquí abajo
@token = PEGA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Crear
POST {{baseUrl}}/disciplines
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Boxeo",
  "description": "Clases de boxeo recreativo"
}

### Listar
GET {{baseUrl}}/disciplines
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ver una (reemplaza el id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/disciplines/ID_DE_UNA_DISCIPLINA
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Modificar
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/disciplines/ID_DE_UNA_DISCIPLINA
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Boxeo recreativo, todos los niveles"
}

### Borrar
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/disciplines/ID_DE_UNA_DISCIPLINA
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Casos de error ---

### Sin token -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/disciplines

### Nombre muy corto -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/disciplines
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "A"
}

### Campo no declarado -> 400 (forbidNonWhitelisted)
POST {{baseUrl}}/disciplines
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Otra",
  "color": "rojo"
}

### Nombre duplicado -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/disciplines
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Boxeo"
}

### id con formato inválido -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/disciplines/no-es-un-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### id inexistente -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/disciplines/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
